  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Number of compounds from the following which will not dissolve in cold <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> solutions but will dissolve in hot <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> solution is _____ .</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6485bfba-8584-42ac-a09f-a98e76473321-9896035.png\" style=\"width: 550px; height: 497px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given compound not dissolve in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cold</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>and</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>NaOH</mi></math> solution, means&nbsp; that does not have&nbsp;carboxylic acid group or&nbsp;phenol group.&nbsp; But&nbsp;the compounds will dissolve in hot <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> solution means they contain&nbsp;ester functional group.</p><p>The compounds <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;contain ester functional group.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
